    {
      "id": 2133,
      "category": "researcher",
      "content": "On `cash.bitaccess.co`, the endpoint for selling bitcoin did not verify the posted amounts of bitcoin and USD. This resulted in users being allowed to sell extremely small amounts of bitcoin for any amount of USD, potentially compromising any bitcoin ATM. Response was speedy on bitaccess's side and this issue is now fixed.",
